    "detailed_description": "(StarBlues)is an equipment-driven third-person shooter produced by Rama Studio, a Shanghai-based indie game team.<br>Play as a robot wanderer in the game, with no name, no designation, and only one goal stored in memory for an unknown amount of time: to search for the core of the ruins.<br>Delve into the ever-changing maze of massive constructs, enhance yourself with the equipment and resources you've acquired from the ruins, destroy hordes of out-of-control enemies and bosses, uncover the secrets of the past, and ultimately learn the truth of the events.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>- Use different weapons to target enemy weaknesses to deal with different combat situations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- A randomly generated combination of maps events and monsters.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Find and equip a variety of firearms and equipment to create your own gear combinations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Dodge and look for opportunities to fight back in a dense attack.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Face hordes of monsters and tackle them with handy weapons.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "(StarBlues)is an equipment-driven third-person shooter produced by Rama Studio, a Shanghai-based indie game team.<br>Play as a robot wanderer in the game, with no name, no designation, and only one goal stored in memory for an unknown amount of time: to search for the core of the ruins.<br>Delve into the ever-changing maze of massive constructs, enhance yourself with the equipment and resources you've acquired from the ruins, destroy hordes of out-of-control enemies and bosses, uncover the secrets of the past, and ultimately learn the truth of the events.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>- Use different weapons to target enemy weaknesses to deal with different combat situations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/a529d31e2d3dc03eb8adceb2415075be.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- A randomly generated combination of maps events and monsters.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/264ff8b7b4fc4366d4f14e1b6fac9b68.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Find and equip a variety of firearms and equipment to create your own gear combinations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/cda90e87cc1aa36e85519356f3e3757d.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Dodge and look for opportunities to fight back in a dense attack.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/5a0fc5c8f7ce81988c99ae8d09ffee18.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Face hordes of monsters and tackle them with handy weapons.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.poster.avif?t=1662085424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.webm?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064570/extras/b98e23edffb2f4a83ce5677468646e8e.mp4?t=1662085424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
